uzzles.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222270/extras/283b74d81d3f23f0491246fad63b26f4.poster.avif?t=1726053119\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222270/extras/283b74d81d3f23f0491246fad63b26f4.apng?t=1726053119\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Use your shield to defend and your gun to attack! (Handy against knife wielding punks and crazed mutants)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222270/extras/283b74d81d3f23f0491246fad63b26f4.poster.avif?t=1726053119\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222270/extras/283b74d81d3f23f0491246fad63b26f4.apng?t=1726053119\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Face your gun down to perform a ROCKET JUMP!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222270/extras/283b74d81d3f23f0491246fad63b26f4.poster.avif?t=1726053119\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222270/extras/283b74d81d3f23f0491246fad63b26f4.apng?t=1726053119\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Epic Boss fights, including a thrilling chainsaw death match.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222270/extras/283b74d81d3f23f0491246fad63b26f4.poster.avif?t=1726053119\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1222270/extras/283b74d81d3f23f0491246fad63b26f4.apng?t=1726053119\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Unlock hidden levels opening a whole new perspective! can you find them all?<br><div class=